  "description": "Download Poly Bridge 2 effortlessly and enjoy a safe experience with no malware. Always get the latest version hassle-free.",
  "editor_review": "Prepare to ignite your engineering imagination with the revamped Poly Bridge app! Featuring new levels, mechanics, and a customized physics engine, you’re set for countless hours of creative fun. Additionally, Adrian Talens returns with a fresh full-length soundtrack, including 13 new tracks alongside 18 remastered favorites. With the introduction of new Spring material, your bridges gain added flexibility, making it easier to achieve victory. Our physics engine has been enhanced to ensure consistent simulation outcomes for all players. So why wait? Jump into the realm of bridge construction and tackle the challenges that Poly Bridge has in store for you!",
